 OVERVIEW                     
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
The copingTracker features    
7                             
0                             
include:                      
7                             
0                             
                              
F  7                          
0                             
  8 song channels             
F  7                          
0                             
256 chains                    
F  7                          
0                             
128 phrases                   
F  7                          
0                             
 32 tables                    
F   7                         
0                             
 32 instrument:               
7     F     7                 
0                             
      SAMPLE instruments      
7                             
0                             
       + internal GM bank     
7     F   7                   
0                             
      MIDI instruments        
7     F       7               
0                             
      CHIPTUNE synth          
F 7   F        7              
0                             
      CHIPDRUM kits           
7     F   7                   
0                             
      LSDJ-style drum kits    
7     F    7                  
0                             
      STACK pad/chord/supersaw
F 7                           
0                             
                              
F7    F  7                    
0                             
-Upto 11 MB of sample memory  
F7                            
0                             
 per open project             
F7                            
0                             
-8bit or 16bit samples up to  
F7                            
0                             
 44.1kHz, mono or stereo      
F7                            
0                             
 16bit 44.1kHz stereo audio   
7                             
0                             
 output                       
7                             
0                             
                              
