copingTracker is powered by   
7                             
0                             
an RP2040/RP2350 microcon-    
7                             
0                             
troller supporting the follow-
7                             
0                             
ing hardware:                 
F 7                           
0                             
                              
F7                            
0                             
-Headphone/Lineout            
F7                            
0                             
-TRS MIDI In & Out, USB MIDI  
F7                            
0                             
 Out                          
F7                            
0                             
-320x240 2.8in LCD display    
F7                            
0                             
-16MB of Flash                
F7                            
0                             
-microSD cards up to 128GB for
F7                            
0                             
 project & sample library     
F7                            
0                             
 storage (projects, samplesï) 
F7                            
0                             
-USB-C for MIDI, charging,    
F7                            
0                             
 mass storage, mirrorUI and   
7                             
0                             
 simple drag&drop firmware    
7                             
0                             
 updates.                     
