C                             
 TRANSPOSITION & SCALES       
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
A project can define a root   
7                             
0                             
note and scale, which together
7                             
0                             
determine its tonal center.   
7                             
0                             
These settings allow phrases  
7                             
0                             
to be transposed within chains
7                             
0                             
while maintaining their       
7                             
0                             
relationship to the project's 
7                             
0                             
key and scale, reducing the   
7                             
0                             
need for duplicate patterns.  
7                             
0                             
                              
F                             
0                             
Instrument exceptions         
F                             
0                             
                              
7                   F   7     
0                             
This mechanism does not apply 
7      F    7                 
0                             
to any Drum instruments or    
7                          F  
0                             
Sample instruments using a GM 
F                 7           
0                             
instrument >= 128 (GM drum    
7                             
0                             
kits).                        
7                             
0                             
                              
F                             
0                             
Input                         
F                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
All chromatic notes can be    
7                             
0                             
entered freely, regardless of 
7                             
0                             
the project scale. Notes not  
7                             
0                             
belonging to the project scale
7                             
0                             
are visually distinguished.   
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
Example, key C, scale Ionic:  
7                             
0                             
                              
7 E  F   C  7                 
0                             
  00 C-3 00 š on-scale        
7 6  7   4                    
0                             
  01 --- --                   
4 6  7   4  7                 
0                             
  02 D-3 00 š on-scale        
7 6  B   4  B                 
0                             
  03 D#3 00 š off-scale       
B E  F   C  7                 
0                             
  04 E-3 00 š on-scale        
7 6  7   4                    
0                             
  05 --- --                   
4 6  7   4  7                 
0                             
  06 G-4 00 š on-scale        
7                             
0                             
                              
7                    F        
0                             
Each chain row has a Transpose
7                             
0                             
setting that applies a semi-  
7                             
0                             
tone offset to all notes in   
7             F               
0                             
that row. The Scale-aware     
7                             
0                             
setting determines whether    
7                             
0                             
the transposed values snap to 
7                             
0                             
the project's scale.      .   
7                             
0                             
                              
7                             
0                             
After those transpositions the
7                             
0                             
global project transposition  
7                             
0                             
is applied.                   
